Hey folks,

Just another reminder about Google Summer of Code:

- If you are a student (bachelor's, master's, PhD, part time, full
time, anything else),
- and you like WireGuard,
- and you want to get paid for hacking on it,
- this summer,
- from wherever you want,
- with mentoring from experts,

then please do email me about it. So far, most of the interest has
been from people who don't actually know anything about the project,
which is a bummer.

I'll be traveling after March 9, so if possible, please try to email
me about any initial interest you have as soon as you can.

Information about everything is here:
https://www.wireguard.com/gsoc/
A list of ideas is here:
https://www.wireguard.com/todo/
Information for students is here:
https://google.github.io/gsocguides/student/

Be in touch!

